  m_text: "<noparse>List<int> cachedAlive = new List<int>(256); // \uD55C \uBC88\uB9CC\n\nvoid Update() {\n  cachedAlive.Clear();             // \uC7AC\uC0AC\uC6A9\n  int total = 0;\n  for (int i = 0; i < enemies.Length; i++)\n    if (enemies[i].Hp > 0) {\n      cachedAlive.Add(i); total += enemies[i].Score; }\n  text.SetText(\"\uC801: {0} \uC810\uC218: {1}\",\n               cachedAlive.Count, total); // TMP \uBB34\uD560\uB2F9\n}</noparse>\n\n<color=#9F9>\uC694\uB839</color>\n\xB7 \uCEEC\uB809\uC158\uC740 \uD544\uB4DC\uC5D0 \uCE90\uC2DC \uD6C4 Clear\n\xB7 LINQ \uB300\uC2E0 for\n\xB7 TMP SetText / StringBuilder \uC7AC\uC0AC\uC6A9"
